abstract: "16 runnable case projects distilled from the Datawhale FDE Case 100
  collection (retrieval, record linkage, 3D bin packing, inventory simulation,
  deterministic semantic-layer agents), each with seeded or real data
  generators, pytest suites and reproducible benchmarks, plus 10 installable
  AI-agent skills."
